### ============================================================
### BFF: Feed — RSS 2.0 of newly imported events (#368)
###
### Read-only, no auth. The 50 events stored most recently that are
### not over, newest first. Takes the event list's filters, so a
### filtered URL is a saved search. An unknown parameter is a 400.
### The public URL is /feed.xml with the same query; nginx and the
### injector forward it here.
### ============================================================

### Everything new, in English
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/feed
Accept: application/rss+xml

### In German: German dates, /de/ links
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/feed?locale=de
Accept: application/rss+xml

### A saved search: techno in Kreuzberg or Friedrichshain
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/feed?genre=techno&district=kreuzberg&district=friedrichshain
Accept: application/rss+xml

### One venue's new events
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/feed?venue=lido
Accept: application/rss+xml

### A reader's conditional poll: paste the ETag of a previous answer, expect 304
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/feed
Accept: application/rss+xml
If-None-Match: W/"paste-the-etag-here"
